</style><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4">Thank you for expressing interest in the Law and Psychology
(PhD) program at Arizona State University. This program <span style="background:
white">is designed to train a new generation of scholars in the field by taking
a broad interdisciplinary approach that combines rigorous training in the law
and psychology field with training in advanced research methodology and
statistics, criminological theory, and contextual training in other subfields
of psychology. The goal of the program is for our students to use this
knowledge to tackle the many important but understudied areas where the legal
system is in desperate need of empirical, psychological research. For more
information feel free to click </span><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/ASLPSYPHD/graduate/false?init=false&amp;nopassive=true"><span style="background:white">here</span></a><span style="background:white">. </span></font></p><font size="4">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4"><span style="background:white">&nbsp;</span></font></p><font size="4">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4"><span style="background:white">Be sure to review our </span><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B44BICxe1BtdUS1zQnQ3YXRUVUE/view?usp=sharing"><span style="background:white">application checklist</span></a><span style="background:white"> for more information about the application process in
an easy to follow format. </span><span style="color:black">Also, please take a
moment to check out our new<span class="apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span></span><a href="http://links.asu.edu/xqkbm">e-magazine</a><span class="apple-converted-space"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="color:black">and see all the exciting work being done by our faculty and
students.</span></font></p><font size="4">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></font></p><font size="4">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font size="4"><span style="color:black">It's important to find the right
fit in graduate school. A great way to learn more about this degree is to
register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can review the dates<span class="apple-converted-space">&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fnewcollege.asu.edu%2Fadmissions%2Fgraduate-student%23info-sessions&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3eyBeebKJl5UB8G4D0hhOqUBSSA">here</a><span style="color:black">, then email me to RSVP for any date you plan to attend.<br>
<br>
Kindest regards,<br>
Graduate Studies<br>
New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences<br>
</span><span style="color:#660000">Arizona State University, West campus<br>
</span><a href="mailto:nc.gradstudies@asu.edu">nc.gradstudies@asu.edu</a></font></p>





